== markup in an entity
<a>
  text [[]
  <b> x=[1] (from an entity)
    text [t] (from an entity)
  text [u] (from an entity)
  text []]
  <c>
written back as it was: yes
== the tokens
  doctype
  text [
]
  start a
  text [[]
  start b (entity)
  text [t] (entity)
  end b (entity)
  text [u] (entity)
  text []]
  start c
  end c
  end a
== set an attribute of the entity's element
<!DOCTYPE a [<!ENTITY e "<b x='1'>t</b>u">]>
<a>[<b x='2'>t</b>u]<c/></a>
== edit an element next to it: the reference is written as its text
<!DOCTYPE a [<!ENTITY e "<b x='1'>t</b>u">]>
<a>[<b x='1'>t</b>u]<c y="3"/></a>
== text replaced in the entity's element
<!DOCTYPE a [<!ENTITY e "<b x='1'>t</b>u">]>
<a>[<b x='1'>new</b>u]<c/></a>
== the parent's text replaced
<!DOCTYPE a [<!ENTITY e "<b x='1'>t</b>u">]>
<a>only</a>
== an element added to the parent
<!DOCTYPE a [<!ENTITY e "<b x='1'>t</b>u">]>
<a>[<b x='1'>t</b>u]<c/><z/></a>
reread: 5
== nested entities, twice
<a>
  <c> (from an entity)
    text [t] (from an entity)
    <d> (from an entity)
  text [t] (from an entity)
  <d> (from an entity)
written back as it was: yes
== comment, instruction and CDATA
<a>
  comment (from an entity)
  pi p (from an entity)
  cdata [x<y] (from an entity)
written back as it was: yes
== a character reference to <
<a>
  text [<b/>]
written back as it was: yes
== namespaces
<a> xmlns:p=[v]
  <p:b> (from an entity)
  <c> xmlns=[u] (from an entity)
    <d> (from an entity)
  <d>
written back as it was: yes
