== a default value
<a> y=[9] x=[1]*
  <b>
written back as it was: yes
== set a defaulted attribute
<!DOCTYPE a [<!ATTLIST a x CDATA "1" y CDATA "2">]><a y="9" x="5"/>
== set another: the defaults are not written
<!DOCTYPE a [<!ATTLIST a x CDATA "1" y CDATA "2">]><a y="9" z="5"/>
x is defaulted: yes
== remove an explicit one
<!DOCTYPE a [<!ATTLIST a x CDATA "1" y CDATA "2">]><a/>
== edit a child: the start tag is as it was
<!DOCTYPE a [<!ATTLIST a x CDATA "1">]><a><b>u</b></a>
== types normalize
<a> y=[c d] z=[  e   f ] x=[p q]*
written back as it was: yes
== first declaration stands
<a> x=[1]* y=[3]*
written back as it was: yes
== a default by entity and character reference
<a> x=[[vA&]]*
written back as it was: yes
== an element without a declaration, and #FIXED
<a> x=[f]*
  <b>
written back as it was: yes
